  "executive_briefing": "As of late August 2026, the digital asset ecosystem is defined by critical regulatory and structural inflection points. The U.S. Senate is racing toward a pivotal September 15 cloture vote on the CLARITY Act (H.R. 3633), a milestone that will determine the future of U.S. crypto market structure. Meanwhile, institutional Bitcoin ETF adoption has transitioned into a clear fatigue phase, experiencing its first calendar year of net outflows in 1H 2026 and tactical treasury sales. In terms of technology, the EVM framework remains dominant but faces strong architectural competition from deterministic, reentrancy-free Bitcoin-native smart contract environments like Clarity. Simultaneously, DeFi protocols are prioritizing non-custodial, direct BTC-to-ETH liquidity networks to replace vulnerable legacy wrapping bridges.",
